{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2021-10-06 09:00:00', 'title': 'NUCOR FASTENER TO EXPAND WITH ACQUISITION OF COIL PROCESSING FACILITY', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., OCT. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT IS EXPANDING ITS NUCOR FASTENER DIVISION WITH THE ACQUISITION OF AN EXISTING STATE-OF-THE-ART COIL PROCESSING FACILITY IN SHELBYVILLE, INDIANA.'}